00:13:51.497 --> 00:13:54.634 size:53% position:73% line:53%
La façon dont il écrit ses

00:13:52.598 --> 00:13:55.668 size:53% position:73% line:53%
rapports dans ses lettres ou ses

00:13:53.633 --> 00:13:56.736 size:53% position:73% line:53%
