00:14:02.141 --> 00:14:05.244 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- On attend l'arrivée de Justin

00:14:03.209 --> 00:14:06.279 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Trudeau et ensuite la mère à la

00:14:04.277 --> 00:14:07.346 size:53% position:73% line:53%
