00:14:14.453 --> 00:14:17.556 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qui vous parle de France.

00:14:15.521 --> 00:14:18.624 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Les premiers Français que j'ai

00:14:16.589 --> 00:14:19.692 size:53% position:73% line:53%
